<link rel="preload" as="image" href="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-wraith.webp' | asset_url }}" imageSizes="(max-width: 760px) 90vw, 46vw" fetchPriority="high"/><div class="scroll-progress" aria-hidden="true"></div><header class="k_45aaab5_header"><div class="k_45aaab5_bar"><a class="k_45aaab5_brand" aria-label="KIKORA home" href="/"><span class="k_c22ae38_identity k_c22ae38_compact"><svg class="k_c22ae38_symbol" viewBox="8 4 112 112" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18 52 64 22 108 39 89 52 66 43 38 61 38 90 18 82Z"></path><path d="M66 76 90 60 110 68 66 97Z" opacity=".55"></path><path d="M48 69v21l18 7v-21Z" opacity=".83"></path></svg><span class="k_c22ae38_word"><svg class="k_3489a55_wordmark " viewBox="0 0 306 40" role="img" aria-label="KIKORA" focusable="false"><path d="M0 0h9v15h6L29 0h12L23 19l20 21H30L15 25H9v15H0Z"></path><path d="M66 0h9v40h-9Z"></path><path d="M101 0h9v15h6l14-15h12L124 19l20 21h-13L116 25h-6v15h-9Z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M167 0h22l10 10v20l-10 10h-22l-10-10V10Zm4 9-5 5v12l5 5h14l5-5V14l-5-5Z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M208 0h30l10 10v10l-8 8 10 12h-12l-11-12h-10v12h-9Zm9 9v11h17l4-4v-3l-4-4Z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m260 40 14-40h15l14 40h-11l-3-10h-16l-3 10Zm16-18h10l-5-14Z"></path></svg></span></span></a><nav class="k_45aaab5_desktopNav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><div class="k_45aaab5_glassNav"><div class="k_45aaab5_glassLink"><a href="/pages/glass">Glass mousepads</a><button type="button" class="k_45aaab5_submenuToggle" aria-label="Glass mousepad collections" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="glass-navigation"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="10" height="10" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m2 4 4 4 4-4"></path></svg></button></div></div><a href="/pages/keycaps">Keycaps</a><a href="/pages/metal">Metal customs</a></nav><div class="k_45aaab5_tools"><select class="k_554b53f_select" aria-label="Site language"><option value="zh" lang="zh-CN">中文</option><option value="en" lang="en" selected="">EN</option><option value="ja" lang="ja">日本語</option></select><button type="button" class="k_45aaab5_menuToggle " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-navigation-menu" aria-label="Open navigation menu"><span>Menu</span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6h16M2 13h16"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main class="kagura-collection-page k_88c3f04_page" lang="en" data-locale="en"><section class="k_88c3f04_hero" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="k_88c3f04_heroCopy"><p class="k_88c3f04_eyebrow">KIKORA / A WORLD WORTH COLLECTING</p><h1 id="about-title">An artist’s world.<br/>A place in yours.</h1><p class="k_88c3f04_heroEnglish" lang="en">COLLECT<br/><span>YOUR WORLD.</span></p><p class="k_88c3f04_intro">We’re building a meeting place for artists and players.<br/>A place where original worlds move beyond the screen and become objects you can hold, live with and keep.</p><a class="k_88c3f04_textLink" href="#story">Explore our story<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><figure class="k_88c3f04_heroVisual"><div class="k_88c3f04_heroImage"><img alt="Blue Wraith-inspired concept study combining character art with the visual language of album covers" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 90vw, 46vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-wraith.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchPriority="high"/><span class="k_88c3f04_imageMark">WORLD<br/>IN PROGRESS.</span></div><figcaption><span>VISUAL STUDY / 001</span><span>Concept study · Not a released collaboration</span></figcaption></figure></section><section class="k_88c3f04_story" id="story" aria-labelledby="story-title"><div class="k_88c3f04_chapterLabel"><span>01 / THE BEGINNING</span><span>A shared connection</span></div><div class="k_88c3f04_storyBody"><h2 id="story-title">Some worlds stay with you<br/>long after you log off.</h2><div class="k_88c3f04_prose"><p>A character you’ve played for countless hours. An album that never leaves your rotation. An illustration that makes you stop scrolling. The work we love does more than look good. It reflects a part of who we are.</p><p>That connection is where KIKORA begins. We want to bring the creative energy of anime, games, music and street culture into art you can live with. Your desk can hold more than equipment. It can hold a little of your history, your taste and your world.</p></div></div></section><section class="k_88c3f04_beliefs" aria-labelledby="beliefs-title"><div class="k_88c3f04_sectionHeading"><p class="k_88c3f04_eyebrow">02 / WHAT WE BELIEVE</p><h2 id="beliefs-title">Three things<br/>every piece should carry.</h2></div><div class="k_88c3f04_beliefGrid"><article class="k_88c3f04_belief"><div class="k_88c3f04_beliefIndex"><span>01</span><span>THE CREATOR</span></div><h3>The artist comes first.</h3><p>We want to know the person behind the style. An original character, a personal story or a world still waiting to be seen can be the beginning of a collection.</p></article><article class="k_88c3f04_belief"><div class="k_88c3f04_beliefIndex"><span>02</span><span>THE EDITION</span></div><h3>More than a number.</h3><p>An edition should reward a closer look and make its artist, concept and release details clear. We see limited editions as a way to give a work the care it deserves. Quantities and release plans will be announced with each confirmed collection.</p></article><article class="k_88c3f04_belief"><div class="k_88c3f04_beliefIndex"><span>03</span><span>THE EVERYDAY</span></div><h3>Keep what moves you close.</h3><p>A collection can live in a display case. It can also live within reach. At the start of a session, between matches or late into the night, art can be part of the time you actually spend.</p></article></div></section><section class="k_88c3f04_creatorStory" aria-labelledby="creators-title"><figure class="k_88c3f04_creatorVisual"><div><img alt="Red and blue Reyna-inspired concept study exploring character art and album-cover composition" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 90vw, 43vw" src="{{ 'kikora-images-album-concept-reyna.webp' | asset_url }}" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;inset:0;color:transparent" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><figcaption>CONCEPT STUDY / Not a released collaboration</figcaption></figure><div class="k_88c3f04_creatorCopy"><p class="k_88c3f04_eyebrow">03 / MANY CREATORS. MANY WORLDS.</p><h2 id="creators-title">The next chapter<br/>needs more voices.</h2><p>We hope to work with independent illustrators and original-IP creators from cities across China. The ambition is to give each artist’s voice room to lead, so collectors can discover a world that feels like their own.</p><p>There is no single style everyone has to follow. A world can be stark, vivid, strange or quietly intimate. What matters is that it belongs to the person creating it.</p><span class="k_88c3f04_status">Artist collaboration program · In development</span><a class="k_88c3f04_textLink" href="mailto:support@kikoragear.com?subject=Artist+collaboration+%2F+KIKORA&amp;body=">Tell us about your work<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section><section class="k_88c3f04_objects" aria-labelledby="objects-title"><div class="k_88c3f04_sectionHeading"><p class="k_88c3f04_eyebrow">04 / ART TAKES FORM</p><h2 id="objects-title">One world.<br/>More ways to keep it.</h2><p>We’re exploring three kinds of objects, bringing the image, the feel and the way you use them into the work itself.</p></div><div class="k_88c3f04_objectGrid"><a class="k_88c3f04_objectCard" href="/pages/glass"><span class="k_88c3f04_objectNumber">01 / GLASS MOUSEPADS</span><h3>Glass mousepads</h3><p>A full canvas at the center of your desk.</p><span class="k_88c3f04_objectLink">Explore the direction<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a class="k_88c3f04_objectCard" href="/pages/keycaps"><span class="k_88c3f04_objectNumber">02 / KEYCAPS</span><h3>Art keycaps</h3><p>Character, color and composition, close at hand.</p><span class="k_88c3f04_objectLink">Explore the direction<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a><a class="k_88c3f04_objectCard" href="/pages/metal"><span class="k_88c3f04_objectNumber">03 / METAL CUSTOMS</span><h3>Metal customs</h3><p>New dimensions for the worlds we collect.</p><span class="k_88c3f04_objectLink">See what’s taking shape<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a></div></section><section class="k_88c3f04_invitation" aria-labelledby="invitation-title"><p class="k_88c3f04_eyebrow">THE STORY IS STILL BEING WRITTEN.</p><h2 id="invitation-title">Find your world.<br/>Keep a piece of it close.</h2><p>Artist collaborations and limited-edition collections are in development.<br/>Follow the next idea, the next artist and the next piece as they take shape.</p><a class="k_88c3f04_button" href="/#newsletter">Follow new editions<!-- --> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section></main><footer class="k_45aaab5_footer"><div class="k_45aaab5_footerGrid"><div class="k_45aaab5_footerBrand"><a aria-label="KIKORA home" href="/"><span class="k_c22ae38_identity "><svg class="k_c22ae38_symbol" viewBox="8 4 112 112" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18 52 64 22 108 39 89 52 66 43 38 61 38 90 18 82Z"></path><path d="M66 76 90 60 110 68 66 97Z" opacity=".55"></path><path d="M48 69v21l18 7v-21Z" opacity=".83"></path></svg><span class="k_c22ae38_word"><svg class="k_3489a55_wordmark " viewBox="0 0 306 40" role="img" aria-label="KIKORA" focusable="false"><path d="M0 0h9v15h6L29 0h12L23 19l20 21H30L15 25H9v15H0Z"></path><path d="M66 0h9v40h-9Z"></path><path d="M101 0h9v15h6l14-15h12L124 19l20 21h-13L116 25h-6v15h-9Z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M167 0h22l10 10v20l-10 10h-22l-10-10V10Zm4 9-5 5v12l5 5h14l5-5V14l-5-5Z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M208 0h30l10 10v10l-8 8 10 12h-12l-11-12h-10v12h-9Zm9 9v